OL,3,GNEWSAFly tipping can have big
OL,4,Aconsequences, police warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmall amounts of fly tipping can create
OL,7,F"massive environmental consequences"
OL,8,Ffor the countryside and land owners,
OL,9,Fpolice say.
OL,11,FAt an operation in Bognor, Sgt Tom
OL,12,FCarter from Sussex Police's rural crime
OL,13,Fteam has told BBC Radio Sussex that a
OL,14,F"small number of people acting
OL,15,Fillegally have the power to create a
OL,16,Fvast problem in the countryside".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
