OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFly tipping can have big
OL,4,Aconsequences, police warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe says fly tipping can create large
OL,7,Fissues for the environment, including
OL,8,Faffecting water courses, contaminating
OL,9,Fground water, and having an especially
OL,10,Fbig impact on farmland, crops and
OL,11,Flivestock.
OL,13,FThe government said on Thursday that
OL,14,Ffly tippers would be forced to pay for
OL,15,Fcleaning up dumped waste under plans
OL,16,Fwhich are being consulted on until
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
